Say which POSIX functions EmbLinkOS does not have.

utils/config.h exists to let a platform declare what its C library is missing;
NetSurf then supplies a stub or takes another path. Every switch below already
has a list of platforms that lack it -- SerenityOS, another from-scratch OS, is
in three of them -- so this adds `nsemblink` to the lists that apply and nothing
else changes.

What EmbLinkOS's libc does not have, and why each is honest rather than lazy:

  REGEX     a POSIX regex engine is ~1500 lines for two call sites in NetSurf
            (a URL match in save_complete). NetSurf's own stub is what every
            other platform without one uses.
  SCANDIR   the dirent walk exists (opendir/readdir); scandir's sort-and-alloc
            wrapper does not.
  REALPATH  the libc normalises paths (path_abs) but does not resolve symlinks,
            which is the part realpath is for.
  INETATON  inet_pton and inet_addr are there; the older spelling is not.
  DIRFD /   the *at family needs a directory-relative resolve in the kernel's
  UNLINKAT/ VFS, which it does not have -- paths are resolved from a process
  FSTATAT   namespace root (docs/USERSPACE_v2.md), not from an open fd.

Any of these becoming true later is a one-line revert of the relevant hunk.

--- a/netsurf/utils/config.h
+++ b/netsurf/utils/config.h
@@ -100,7 +100,8 @@
 
 #define HAVE_INETATON
 #if (defined(_WIN32) || \
-     defined(__serenity__))
+     defined(__serenity__) || \
+     defined(nsemblink))
 #undef HAVE_INETATON
 #endif
 
@@ -115,7 +116,7 @@
 #endif
 
 #define HAVE_REALPATH
-#if (defined(_WIN32))
+#if (defined(_WIN32) || defined(nsemblink))
 #undef HAVE_REALPATH
 char *realpath(const char *path, char *resolved_path);
 #endif
@@ -142,21 +143,22 @@
 
 #define HAVE_SCANDIR
 #if (defined(_WIN32) ||				\
-     defined(__serenity__))
+     defined(__serenity__) ||			\
+     defined(nsemblink))
 #undef HAVE_SCANDIR
 #endif
 
 #define HAVE_DIRFD
 #define HAVE_UNLINKAT
 #define HAVE_FSTATAT
-#if (defined(_WIN32) || defined(__riscos__) || defined(__HAIKU__) || defined(__BEOS__) || defined(__amigaos4__) || defined(__AMIGA__) || defined(__MINT__))
+#if (defined(_WIN32) || defined(__riscos__) || defined(__HAIKU__) || defined(__BEOS__) || defined(__amigaos4__) || defined(__AMIGA__) || defined(__MINT__) || defined(nsemblink))
 #undef HAVE_DIRFD
 #undef HAVE_UNLINKAT
 #undef HAVE_FSTATAT
 #endif
 
 #define HAVE_REGEX
-#if (defined(__serenity__))
+#if (defined(__serenity__) || defined(nsemblink))
 #undef HAVE_REGEX
 #endif
 
